    claim = ["Schools should ban phone use during class time, because the evidence shows that notifications reduce what students learn from a lecture.", "A district should require phones to be stored during lessons because they lower learning.", "A district should allow phones only for specific educational uses, because the evidence that a full ban improves scores is weak but phones reduce attention.", "Districts should not ban phones completely because the evidence of benefit is not statistically significant and some students use phones to manage anxiety."]
